\subsection{2.7 Implications for Multi-Domain Sovereignty}
The invariance bridge ensures that macro-scale astrophysical dynamics
and micro-scale cellular dynamics remain mathematically consistent.
This eliminates contradictions between smooth and granular models,
providing a unified invariant-based framework.